{"page_content": "《Spring Boot 自动配置速记》\nSpring Boot 自动配置的核心是自动装配。常见入口包括 @SpringBootApplication、@EnableAutoConfiguration，加载自动配置类后再结合条件注解决定是否生效。", "metadata": {"role_code": "java_backend", "source_table": "knowledge_doc", "source_id": 1, "title": "Spring Boot 自动配置速记", "type": "knowledge"}}
{"page_content": "《MySQL 索引知识点》\n索引常见结构是 B+Tree。联合索引遵循最左前缀原则，合理使用覆盖索引可以减少回表。函数运算、隐式类型转换和范围条件可能导致索引失效。", "metadata": {"role_code": "java_backend", "source_table": "knowledge_doc", "source_id": 2, "title": "MySQL 索引知识点", "type": "knowledge"}}
{"page_content": "《Redis 场景速记》\nRedis String 常用于缓存与计数，Hash 适合对象存储，List 适合消息队列，Set 适合去重，ZSet 常用于排行榜。", "metadata": {"role_code": "java_backend", "source_table": "knowledge_doc", "source_id": 3, "title": "Redis 场景速记", "type": "knowledge"}}
{"page_content": "《Vue 响应式知识点》\nVue2 通过 Object.defineProperty 劫持属性，Vue3 使用 Proxy 拦截对象操作。核心目标都是在依赖变化时触发视图更新。", "metadata": {"role_code": "web_frontend", "source_table": "knowledge_doc", "source_id": 4, "title": "Vue 响应式知识点", "type": "knowledge"}}
